      "source": "import M0Bridge\nopen MeasureTheory Obligations045.M0 Obligations046.Bridge\nexample {Ω : Type*} [MeasurableSpace Ω] (M : Domain) (N : ℕ) (a : Fin M.K → Bool)\n    (μ : Measure Ω) (X : Fin M.K → ℕ → Ω → Bool) (hN : 0 < N)\n    (hmeas : AEMeasurable (snapshot M N X) μ) :\n    (∫ ω, limitingLoss (memberAverage M (indicator X) N ω) ∂μ) = conditionalError M N a := by\n  exact ambient_conditional_error_representation M N a μ X hN hmeas\n",
      "exitCode": 1,
